      <MissionDesc>WE BRING TOGETHER SAN DIEGO'S SOFTWARE TECHNOLOGY, DATA ANALYTICS AND CLOUD-BASED APPLICATION COMMUNITIES TO PROMOTE INDUSTRY GROWTH AND SUCCESS, TO ADDRESS COMMON TECHNICAL CHALLENGES AND BUSINESS OPPORTUNITIES, AND ADVOCATE FOR COMMON INTEREST.</MissionDesc>
      <SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>false</SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>
